  "body": "Demo — sample data, nothing is saved\nOpen your saved card next, or a blank card if none exists.\nReset demo\nOpen my saved card\nSkip to main content\nLT\nLESSON TAB CARD\nEditor\nDemo\nPrivacy\nEDIT THE SAMPLE LESSON CARD\n\nChange the G to C exercise below.\n\nThis sandbox never reads or changes your saved card.\n\nINPUT\n\nType the lesson\nVALID\nLesson syntax\nExport SVG\nExport PNG\nCopy share link\nClear card\n\nReady to export and share.\n\nShow the lesson format\n\nCtrl + Enter exports SVG. Alt + 1 returns to the editor.\n\nOUTPUT\n\nCheck the card\n900 × 540\nLESSON TAB CARD\nG to C change\nG\nCAPO 0\n2\n1\n○\n○\n○\n3\ne|--3---3---0---0--|\nB|--0---0---1---1--|\nG|--0---0---0---0--|\nD|--0---0---2---2--|\nA|--2---2---3---3--|\nE|--3---3----------|\nTEACHER NOTE\nCount four beats. Keep every change quiet.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nMake a card in three steps\n01 / Type\nFill the short lesson fields. The preview changes as you type.\n02 / Check\nFix any named line before you hand the card over.\n03 / Share\nExport an image or copy a link for the student.\n\nLIMITS AND PRIVACY\n\nA lesson card, not a score editor\n\nThere is no song library, playback, account, or tracking. Lesson Tab Card stores one draft in your browser. New share links keep lesson text after the # sign.\n\nOPTIONAL PACK / $9 ONCE\n\nPrint four cards on one sheet\n\nThe free editor exports one lesson card as SVG or PNG. The worksheet pack adds a four-card SVG page for lesson folders.\n\nSample worksheet preview is open in this demo.\n\nExport sample 4-card worksheet\n\nLeave the demo before buying or verifying a license.\n\nLesson Tab Card — Make a clear guitar lesson card.\n\nPrivacy\nTerms\nBuilt by Param Factory\n(external site)\n\nv1.2 / build 2026.08.29\n\nDemo — Lesson Tab Card",
